hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"21027","Yahya ibn Adam narrated to us, Ibn al-Mubarak narrated to us, from Mamar, from a shaykh of Banu Tamim, from Abu Sawd, he said: I heard the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) say: the wicked oath by which a man cuts off the wealth of a Muslim severs kinship."
